"<b>概括名词</b>（summary nouns）：issue, trend, approach, development, measure, factor, tendency。上一句讲了一件事，下一句用 <i>This development ...</i> 承接。": "<b>概括名詞</b>（summary nouns）：issue, trend, approach, development, measure, factor, tendency。前の文で述べた事柄を、次の文で <i>This development ...</i> と受けます。",
"<b>替换</b>：同一个词不连续出现三次；用同义词或代词：children → they / young people / the younger generation。连接词不要每句都加。": "<b>言い換え</b>：同じ語を3回続けない。類義語や代名詞を使う：children → they / young people / the younger generation。接続語を毎文に付けないこと。",
